    "status": "present",
    "value": "You are given the head of a singly linked list whose node values are distinct, and an array that is a subset of those values. Two chosen values are connected if their nodes are adjacent in the list. Return the number of connected components among the chosen values, that is, the number of maximal runs of consecutive list nodes whose values are all in the array."
  },
